                                "example_id": "e62170d1-82df-417d-a12f-db72cdcb3c4b",
                                "sense_id": "45924dc6-5cea-35f8-ab19-6ca76a1f3d33",
                                "text": "To one consent, may work contrariously:\n As many arrows, loosed several ways,\n Come to one mark."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eca84395-518a-4ede-9c52-2d819e8422e9",
                                "sense_id": "45924dc6-5cea-35f8-ab19-6ca76a1f3d33",
                                "text": "Thou might not chaunge but if thou from rule of reason varye, in whiche variaunce to come to thilke blysse desyred contrariously thou werches"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
